### DEPOSIT

### Positive test: Authorized user can add deposit less than 5000
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": 100
}

### Positive test: Authorized user can add deposit amount equal 5000
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": 5000
}

### Positive test: Authorized user can add deposit amount less than 5000
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": 4999.99
}

### Positive test: Authorized user can add deposit amount less than 5000
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": 0.01
}


### Negative test: Authorized user can not add deposit amount more than 5000
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": 5000.01
}

### Negative test: Authorized user can not add negative deposit amount
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": -200
}

### Negative test: Authorized user can not add deposit to not existing account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "id": 24,
  "balance": 200
}

### Negative test: Authorized user can not add deposit to account of another user
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "id": 3,
  "balance": 200
}

### TRANSFER MONEY

### Positive test: Authorized user can transfer money to another account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 9999.99
}

### Positive test: Authorized user can transfer money to another account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 0.01
}

### Negative test: Authorized user cannot transfer money to another account more than 10000
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 10000.01
}

### Negative test: Authorized user cannot transfer money to another account exceed personal account balance
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 8000
}

### Negative test: Authorized user cannot transfer negative ammount of money to another account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 2,
  "amount": -900
}

### Positive test: Authorized user can transfer money to another personal account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 900
}

### Negative test: Authorized user can not transfer money to not existing account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 12,
  "amount": 900
}

### CHANGE NAME

### Positive test: Authorized user can change user name with valid name
PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "name": "Alice Ivanova"
}

### Negative test: Authorized user can not change user name with name length more than 2 words
PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "name": "Alice Ivanova Petrovna"
}

### Negative test: Authorized user can not change user name without letters, only digits
PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "name": "4567 8790"
}

### Negative test: Authorized user can not change user name without letters, only symbols
PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=

{
  "name": "&*^%$"
}


### Positive test: Authorized user can get profile info
GET http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6c3RvbmdQYXNzd29yZDQ1XyM=








